    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "FE35EED32F281E40",
      "text": "Willkommen in der Arena von Mesclarra!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "FE35F1D32F282359",
      "text": "Lass mich dich zuallererst als [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0E0E,0000)]HerausfordererHerausforderin\\nregistrieren...\\c\\nDein Name ist [VAR 0x0100(0000)], sagst du?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0E0E",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "FE35F0D32F2821A6",
      "text": "Bevor du dich mit Arenaleiter Aoki messen\\nkannst, musst du die Arenaprüfung bestehen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "FE35F3D32F2826BF",
      "text": "Deine Aufgabe wird es sein, ein [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]geheimes[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Gericht zu bestellen[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "FE35F2D32F28250C",
      "text": "Das besagte Gericht gibt es in der [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Schatzstube[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\ndem beliebtesten Restaurant in Mesclarra.\\c\\nGelingt es dir, das Richtige zu bestellen,\\nhast du bestanden.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "FE35F5D32F282A25",
      "text": "Außer dir versuchen sich aktuell noch drei\\nweitere Herausforderer an dieser Arenaprüfung.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "FE35F4D32F282872",
      "text": "Sie haben alle jeweils einen anderen Hinweis zu\\ndem geheimen Gericht anvertraut bekommen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "FE35F7D32F282D8B",
      "text": "Ihr bestreitet Pokémon-Kämpfe gegeneinander\\nund wer verliert, muss dem Gewinner verraten,\\r\\nwas er über das Gericht weiß.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "FE35F6D32F282BD8",
      "text": "Sobald du alle Hinweise erhalten hast,\\nkannst du das geheime Gericht beim\\r\\nPersonal in der Schatzstube bestellen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "FE3289D32F253CCA",
      "text": "Am Ende besteht nur der eine Herausforderer,\\nder in der Lage ist, die korrekte Bestellung\\r\\naufzugeben.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "FE328AD32F253E7D",
      "text": "Nun denn, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], dein Hinweis lautet:\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]So mögen’s unsere Stammgäste[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "FE3287D32F253964",
      "text": "Es könnte also nicht schaden, wenn du dich mal\\nbei den Stammgästen der Schatzstube umhörst.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
